+              <li>Separate raw data, intermediate files, final outputs, and reports.</li>
+              <li>Document where input data came from.</li>
+              <li>Preserve small configuration files and sample sheets.</li>
+              <li>Avoid committing large generated files unless instructed.</li>
+              <li>Record failed or unexpected results when they affect interpretation.</li>
